        <div class="col-md-8 order-first">
            <p>In 1959, RolAir was formed with one simple goal: Produce the finest compressors known to mankind. Decades later, the goal remains the same. As a third-generation manufacturer known for quality and craftsmanship, RolAir compressors are built in the heart of Wisconsin exclusively for professional contractors and homeowners. They appreciate Rol-Air's attention to detail, rugged performance and wide variety of options. But above all, they appreciate that their sole focus is compressors - nothing else.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12">
            <p>If you're looking for a "specialize-in-nothing" company concerned with nail guns, power tools and sales gimmicks, go to a box house. If, on the other hand, you're looking to partner with a company built on decades of industry knowledge, experience and unparalleled customer service, welcome to RolAir.</p>
            <p>If you are the do-it-yourselfer, homeowner or small contractor, look nowhere else other than RolAir's exclusive hand carry air compressors. Most of these compressors feature a cast-iron cylinder, a single stage compressor pump, stainless steel reed valves, and splash lubrication to ensure longer pump life.</p>
            <p>If you are the serious contractor - the RolAir wheelbarrow air compressors are some of the best on the market. They all feature a heavy duty and single stage pump and a cast-iron twin cylinder tank. They have many different models on the market, so you are sure to find a compressor that will suit your needs. </p>
            <p>Feel free to browse around the following sections for more information on Rol-Air air compressors. We stock a wide variety of parts and accessories, including pressure switches, filters, an oil. As always, give us a call at 1-866-203-2944 for more information.</p>
            <p>This is a great line of air compressors and competitively priced!</p>
